==Gamemode Specific==
Non-standard gamemodes typically have different map sets than regular. Some of these gamemodes can only be played on custom maps, and thus do not have any selection for map sets. Other gamemodes, however, can be played on regular maps, and have unique map sets.

===Dice & Destruction===
[[Dice & Destruction]] features 6 unique map sets, alongside using the standard Tournament 1v1 and Tournament 2v2 sets. These map sets are similar to their standard counterparts, typically only removing maps with ceilings or high item spawns from the pool.

