===Snowbrawl FFA Map Set===
[[Snowbrawl]] previously featured a unique '''FFA''' map set, alongside a '''Big''' map set which was identical to the regular Big map set.

These were removed in [[Patch 9.01]], replaced with standard map sets.

Despite its removal, this map set still remained in the files and was updated for a few patches. It was finally removed in [[Patch 9.06]]

